|PAM_EDOC|1 |2910|2 |19|3 |3 |54|13|0 |111|3 |0 |3118|
|PAM_EDOC|2 |2 |4456|36|10|37|49|0 |0 |2 |2 |0 |4594|
|PAM_EDOC|3 |4 |39|5024|30|41|55|4 |0 |1 |2 |0 |5200|
|PAM_EDOC|4 |7 |16|24|1745|45|44|6 |0 |1 |0 |0 |1888|
